Package: lemctl
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ca-certificates
Description: Lemming diagnostic command line tool for AlpineVS
 Queries Lucius forwarding information and SAI attributes.
 Remote connections verify TLS certificates; plaintext is restricted
 to literal loopback IP addresses.
